KTPs have enabled academic partners to strengthen their knowledge of industry challenges, leading to more industry -relevant research and teaching materials,  academic publications, and helping them to lever further f unding .KTPs have helped to strengthen the ability  of academics  to engage with businesses and transfer knowledge.KTPs have also helped to progress academic careers, and a small number have generated IP and/or spinout businesses.;smart_collaboration_tools;0.824214518070221
KTPs have  had  a legacy effect for academics : almost all academics surveyed said the benefits gained from the KTP were sustained after it was completed and the majority of those academics continue d to reap the benefits.7.KTPs have generate d wider benefits for the KB institution , including improved profile and credibility, providing material on impact for REF/KEF case studies, and widening and strengthening business networks.;nanotechnology;0.5083682537078857
